			"widgets_values":[
				"你好！我是视频分析专家。这段视频采用 cute stop-motion felt animation style.\n\n以下是为您整理的拉片笔记：\n\n## 视频提示词\n\n| 镜号 | 景别/角度 | 运动 | 画面内容 | 音频 | 时长(秒) |\n|------|-----------|------|----------|------|----------|\n| 1 | Close-up/Eye-level | Static | 画面描述：Two felt creatures in hats sit on sand. Left one hammers a nail. A flower grows on right one's hat.<br>Sora提示词参考：Stop-motion felt animation, cute black creatures, straw hats, desert, hammering nail, growing flower, macro lens. | BGM: None; SFX: Hammer strikes, sprouting sound; Voice: None; Emotion: Quirky. | 5 |\n| 2 | Close-up/Eye-level | Static | 画面描述：Left creature plucks the pink flower from the right hat and holds it up.<br>Sora提示词参考：Stop-motion felt animation, black creature plucking pink flower, desert, macro lens, shallow depth of field. | BGM: None; SFX: Plucking snap, magical ding; Voice: None; Emotion: Comedic. | 5 |\n\n---\n\n## 总结描述\n\n### 画面风格\nMiniature stop-motion felt animation. Warm sandy color palette with natural lighting. Macro photography utilizing shallow depth of field to highlight textures.\n\n### 音频风格\nNo BGM. Relies entirely on crisp Foley sound effects. Rhythmic hammer hits and a final magical ding dictate the comedic timing."
			],
